title: Lane Change Turn Signal Flash Count
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Lane Change Turn Signal Flash Count
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Lighting] [Years: 2022-2026] [Original Title: Change Number of
  Blinks for Turn Signal Tap]

  Confirm your current value matches the 3 blink Default value before changing. (target
  5 blinks)

  80-none, 84=1, 88-2, 8C-3, 90-4, 94-5 (target), 98-6, 9C-7, A0-8, A4-9, AB-10'
steps:
- module: SCCM
  address: 724-01-01
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx **xx xx--
    type: continuous
    user_input: required
  notes: 80=none, 84=1, 88=2, 8C=3, 90=4, 94=5, 98=6, 9C=7, A0=8, A4=9, A8=10
